  "text": "\r\n\t Town of Northwood NH Departments \r\nTown of Northwood NH \nDepartments \nAdministration Department \nAssessing \nBuilding, Health, and Code Enforcement \nChesley Memorial Library \nCommunity Profile \nEmergency Management \nFinance Department \nFire Department \nHealth Department \nHighway Department \nHuman Services \nLand Use Department \nPolice Department \nRecreation Department \nRequests for Proposals \nTown Clerk/Tax Collector \nTown Information \nTown Treasurer \nTransfer Station/Recycling Center \nBoards & Committees \nBoard of Selectmen \nBudget Committee \nCable Advisory Committee \nCapital Improvements Plan  \nCemetery Trustees \nConservation Commission \nEconomic Development Committee \nHighway and Facilities Advisory Committee \nModerator \nPlanning Board \nPolice Commission \nPublic Safety Facilities Evaluation Committee \nRecreation Commission \nTown of Northwood 250th Anniversary Steering Committee \nTrustee of Trust Funds \nVillage of Northwood Ridge Water District \nZoning Board of Adjustment \nTown Information \nFiles & Documents \nPost Files \nLinks of Interest \nTown History \nTerms of Use \nContact Us \nPothole Reporting \nAbout \nNorthwood, a bucolic town in southeastern New Hampshire, was founded in 1773 when its first settlers successfully petitioned the Governor's Council requesting separation from Nottingham. Since this section of Nottingham had been known as the great north woods, the newly formed town was called Northwood. \nNorthwood Town Offices are open from 9:00am to 4:00pm Monday, Tuesday & Thursday and 12:00pm to 4:00pm on Wednesday. See Town Clerk/Tax Collector page for hours. \nHistory \r\nSchools \r\nCalendar \nShow Menu \r\nShowing all Departments \r\nAdministration Department \nPhone:  (603) 942-5586 ext 2013 \nEmail:  adminassist@northwoodnh.org \nNorthwood Town Hall \n818 First NH Turnpike \nNorthwood, NH 03261 \nThe administration department is responsible for Town Hall reception and general clerical duties, property assessing, and public access TV coordination and programming. Department staff also provides support to the Building Department and the Town's contracted Assessor.   \nThe overall day to day municipal operations of the Town is managed by the Town Administrator, who is appointed by the Board of Selectmen. \nHours: \nMonday, Tuesday & Thursday \n9:00 a.m. - 4:00 p.m. \nWednesday \n12:00 p.m. - 4:00 p.m. \nAssessing \nPhone:  (603) 942-5586 ext 2006 \nEmail:  assessing@northwoodnh.org \nNorthwood Town Hall \n818 First NH Turnpike \nNorthwood, NH 03261 \nBuilding, Health, and Code Enforcement \nPhone:  (603) 942-5586 ext 2003 \nEmail:  bice@northwoodnh.org \nDevin Haley, Building Inspector/CEO \nTown of Northwood  \n818 First New Hampshire Turnpike \nNorthwood, NH. 03261 \nBuilding Inspections are Scheduled: \n﻿﻿Monday Thru Thursday \n9:00 a.m. - 2:00 p.m. \nPlease call at least 24 hours in advance to schedule and leave a message. \nChesley Memorial Library \nPhone:  (603) 942-5472 \nEmail:  chesleylib@gmail.com \n8 Mountain Avenue \nNorthwood, NH 03261 \nCommunity Profile \nPhone:  (603) 942-5586 ext 2020 \nEmail:  nirvine@northwoodnh.org \nTown of Northwood \n818 First NH Turnpike \nNorthwood, NH 03261 \nEmergency Management \nPhone:  (603) 942-5586 ext 2016 \nChief Glen Drolet, Emergency Management Director \nNorthwood Town Hall \n818 First NH Turnpike \nNorthwood, NH 03261 \nFinance Department \nPhone:  (603) 942-5586 ext 2012 \nEmail:  cmanter@northwoodnh.org \nNorthwood Town Hall \n818 First NH Turnpike \nNorthwood, NH 03261 \nThe Finance Department oversees all accounting, debt and cash management services for the Town of Northwood. Additionally it provides support services to the Town Administrator for preparing and administering the annual Town budget. \nFire Department \nPhone:  (603) 942-9103 \nRidge Fire Station: \n499 First NH Turnpike \nNarrows Fire Station: \n85 Main Street \nFax (603) 942-9104 \nThe Northwood Fire and Rescue Department protects approximately 4,000 residents in an area of 27 square miles. In the summer, the population nearly doubles. The Department has 35 members serving under the direction of the Fire Chief, Deputy Chief, three Captains, and five Lieutenants. There is also a “support” crew and a fire explorers post.  \nHealth Department \nPhone:  (603) 942-5586 ext 2003 \nEmail:  bice@northwoodnh.org \nDevin Haley, Health Officer \nNorthwood Town Hall \n818 First NH Turnpike \nNorthwood, NH  03261 \nHighway Department \nPhone:  (603) 202-6751 \nEmail:  DPW@northwoodnh.org \nNorthwood Highway Department \nphysical address: Town Works Way \nmailing address: 818 First NH Turnpike \nNorthwood, NH  03301 \nThe Highway Department maintains all Town Roads from repairing to snow removal. The  Department also processes permits for any new driveways or any excavation on any Town right-of-way. \nHuman Services \nPhone:  (603) 942-5586 ext 2012 \nHuman Services Department \n818 First New Hampshire Turnpike \nNorthwood, NH 03261 \nThe Northwood Human Services Office provides assistance to qualified individuals for basic living needs in accordance with NH RSA 165 and the Town of Northwood General Assistance Guidelines and Basic Needs Policy. \nLand Use Department \nPhone:  (603) 942-5586 ext 2004 \nEmail:  landuseassist@northwoodnh.org \nNorthwood Town Hall \n818 First NH Turnpike \nNorthwood, NH 03281 \nThe Land Use Department is actively involved in all matters relating to land use, development, and preservation.  \nPolice Department \nPhone:  (603) 942-9101 \n1020 First NH Turnpike \nNorthwood, NH 03261 \nFax (603) 942-9102  \nFor more information, please visit  http://www.northwoodpolice.org \nRecreation Department \nPhone:  (603) 942-5586 ext 2007 \nEmail:  recreation@northwoodnh.org \nNorthwood Town Hall \n818 First NH Turnpike \nNorthwood, NH 03261 \nIt is the mission of the Northwood Recreation Department to create recreational opportunities for growth and enhancement by developing an array of diverse, affordable programs and events that promote community service and environmental awareness while meeting the physical, mental, social, and psychological needs of our community. \nRequests for Proposals \nOffice of the Town Administrator \n818 First New Hampshire Turnpike \nNorthwood, NH 03261 \nThe Town will post all open RFPs to this location. \nTown Clerk/Tax Collector \nPhone:  (603) 942-5586 ext 2002 \nEmail:  mrusso@northwoodnh.org \nTown Clerk & Tax Collector \nMarisa Russo \n818 First NH Turnpike \nNorthwood NH 03261 \nThis is a combined office of Town Clerk/Tax Collector pursuant to RSA 41:45-a. He/She is elected to a 3 year term and must be a Northwood resident. The duties of the clerk include preserving town records, recording vital statistics, dog licensing, is an election official and also registers motor vehicles, boats, trailers and renews mopeds. Duties of the Tax Collector include issuing of tax bills, land use change, timber/gravel supplements. The Tax Collector also records liens and corresponds with the Registry of Deeds. \nBusiness Hours excluding holidays: \nMon.-Thu. 8:30am-1:00pm  \n                    1:30pm-4:00pm \nclosed daily for lunch 1:00pm-1:30pm \nSat. 1st Sat. of each month 8:30am-11:30am \nTown Information \nPhone:  (603) 942-5586 \n818 First NH Turnpike \nNorthwood, NH 03261 \nTown Treasurer \nPhone:  (603) 942-5586 ext 2014 \nEmail:  treasurer@northwoodnh.org \nSandy Priolo \nNorthwood Town Hall \n818 First NH Turnpike \nNorthwood, NH  03261 \nTransfer Station/Recycling Center \nPhone:  (603) 942-5586 ext 2008 \nEmail:  DPW@northwoodnh.org \n1 Town Works Way \nNorthwood, NH 03261 \nHours of Operation  \nYear-Round Hours\tJanuary 1 to December 31 \nSunday\t10:00 AM to 4:00 PM \nMonday\t1:00 PM to 7:00 PM \nWednesday\t1:00 PM to 7:00 PM \r\n\t\t\t\t  Home \r\n\t\t\t\t  Agendas & Minutes \r\n\t\t\t\t  News & Notices \r\n\t\t\t\t  Files & Forms \r\n\t\t\t\t  Town Calendar \r\n\t\t\t\t  Departments \r\n\t\t\t\t  Boards & Committees \r\n\t\t\t\t  Find it Fast \r\n\t\t\t\t  Search \r\nTown of Northwood NH \n818 1st New Hampshire Turnpike \nNorthwood, NH \n(603) 942-5586 \nNorthwood Town Offices are open from 9:00am to 4:00pm Monday, Tuesday & Thursday and 12:00pm to 4:00pm on Wednesday. See Town Clerk/Tax Collector page for hours. \nTown Services \nRecreation \nPolice \nFire \nSchools \nLibrary \nTown Info \nAll Online Transactions \nBuilding Permits \nDirectory \nHistory \nMinutes \nRecycling \nAssessing \nCar Registration \nTaxes \nCopyright© 2026 Town of Northwood NH. All rights reserved.\r\nWebsite by  Legend Software \n ",
